pc5 : (A : Type 1) (x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 : A) → PathP (λ i → A) x0 x1 → PathP (λ i → A) x1 x2 → PathP (λ i → A) x2 x3 →
  PathP (λ i → A) x3 x4 → PathP (λ i → A) x4 x5 → PathP (λ i → A) x0 x5
pc5 A x0 x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 = pcat A x0 x1 x5 p1 (pcat A x1 x2 x5 p2 (pcat A x2 x3 x5 p3 (pcat A x3 x4 x5 p4 p5)))
